89

Verdicts. The verifier emits one of five verdicts: V ERIFIED, R EFUTED -P ROOF (RP, an unconditional witness), C ONTRACT-V IOLATION (CV, sound under the caller-rely assume e ), L IBRARYWARN (LW, a conservative warning on dispatch outside the modeled fragment), and A BSTAIN. The
soundness theorem (Theorem 2) covers RP and CV; LW and A BSTAIN make no claim.

