For each nn.Module class M we synthesise a contract C(M ) = (assume M , guarantee M ), with
assume M a refinement on input types and guarantee M a refinement on output types. Sequential composition (e.g. nn.Sequential) discharges guarantee M1 ⇒ assume M2 locally; parallel composition
(residual sums, QKV split) treats each sibling independently and joins the guarantees:

