Empirical Evaluation

198

4.1

Real-source benchmark: 488 nn.Module blocks + 60 historical PyTorch shape bugs

199

Corpora. The block corpus is 488 standalone nn.Module subclasses programmatically extracted
(via inspect.getsource) from the public release tags of TORCHVISION 0.24.1, TIMM 1.0.26, and
TRANSFORMERS 4.57.3, content-addressed by SHA-256. The bug corpus is 60 historical PyTorch
shape bugs mined from the issue tracker via 20+ keyword queries, of which we kept only those that
admit a self-contained ≤ 40-line CPU repro that raises the cited RuntimeError. The categories span
attention dim (5), broadcasting (9), view/reshape (9), conv-channel (6), linear-in/out (4), einsum (5),
transpose-axes (4), batchnorm-features (4), embedding-index (3), and other (11).

