Framing. Theorem 5 below is a necessary-direction inclusion statement, not an equivalence: on the
catalogue intersection it claims that every shape/dtype/rank guard Dynamo installs is a refinement
variable of some Section 2 rule. We deliberately do not claim that every Dynamo recompile is
shape-driven; the empirical 48/544 (8.8%) in-contract recompile rate quantifies the gap to a twodirectional reading. The proof reduces rule-by-rule to PyTorch 2.9.1’s specialiser bits as exposed by
torch. dynamo.symbolic convert; we pin the freeze SHA in Section F and mark the statement
as audited against that release rather than as a moving-target equivalence.

