Calibrated framing. Lean checks the rule table, not the analyser. The parser, the AST extractor,
the analyser implementation, the backward verifier, and the Z3 dispatch are not mechanised. The
assume/guarantee composition rule (Theorem 3) is mechanised on the same 3-operator DSL as
(lemma ag composition); extending the proof to the full 79-handler Python rule-set is left as future
work. The Lean side exports its operator registry as JSON so the Python analyser cannot silently
refer to an operator the Lean side does not declare. The per-handler soundness scope table (Table 7,
appendix) maps each of T ENSOR G UARD’s 79 shape handlers to one of {Lean-audited, pen-and-paper,
