This section gives a self-contained small-step operational semantics for the statement fragment FTG ,
establishes Preservation (Theorem 10) and Progress (Theorem 11) as formal theorems, derives the
classical Soundness corollary, and provides full proofs. Every operator typing rule cited is from
Sections 2 and B; no rule is invented here.

