Silent-miss autopsy on the historical 60-bug corpus

The four V ERIFIED-but-buggy items (bug 001, bug 002, bug 006, bug 007) split as follows.
bug 001 (SDPA enable gqa=True attn mask broadcast): the T-SDPA rule (Section B) is stated
for the standard (B, H, T, D) contract; the GQA-distinct query-head count is an SDPA-rule premise
we did not state, so the SMT obligation Hq = Hk that should have fired was never raised. bug 002
(torch.isclose broadcast on a 0-dim NaN scalar): isclose is not in the operator catalogue (Section A); the analyser treated it as a passthrough rather than a broadcast op and never emitted the obligation shape(a)=broadcast(shape(a),shape(b)). bug 006 (nn.Conv1d with channels-last
input): the rule T-C ONV 1 D reads the input layout from a positional channel index (cin = shape[1]);
the layout-misordered repro lay outside the layout-fixed fragment. bug 007 (intra-batch dynamic
